  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Primary Health Care provision for vulnerable populations affected by food insecurity and malnutrition &#xbf; Sudan: Mother and Child Cash Transfer Plus for the First 1,000 Days of Life</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overall objective (Impact): &lt;/strong&gt;to improve the health conditions of pregnant and lactating women and children under two years of age including IDPs, refugees and host communities affected by extreme poverty, food insecurity and malnutrition in Sudan.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objective (Outcome)&lt;/strong&gt;: to increase sustainable access to and demand for quality Primary Health Care (PHC), nutrition and Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH), Protection and Social Protection services among pregnant and lactating women and children under two years of age including IDPs, refugees and Host Communities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;Output 1:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt; Primary healthcare, nutrition and Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) services at Primary Health Care (PHC) centre and community level improved through Mother and Child Cash Transfer Plus (MCCT+) Programme, including for IDPs, refugees and host communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;Output 3:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;Socio-cultural behavioural and gender barriers to health and nutrition for pregnant and lactating women and children under two years of age are reduced through Mother and Child Cash Transfer Plus (MCCT+) Programme. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;Output 4&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;: Financial barriers to maternal and child healthcare are reduced through the implementation of Mother and Child and Cash Transfer Plus (MCCT+) Programme.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
